你可以这样回答。

13
00:00:43,520 --> 00:00:49,520
The first role of a safety officer is to advise management on health and safety aspects of an organization
安全员的第一项职责是就组织的健康与安全方面向管理层提供建议。

14
00:00:49,680 --> 00:00:55,120
