136
00:07:45,920 --> 00:07:57,920
You can define Permit to Work's written authorization issued by an authorized person to a requester to carry out the activity for a certain location, for a certain period of time with safety precautions.
你可以这样定义工作许可证：它是由授权人员签发给申请人的书面授权，允许其在特定地点、特定时间段内，在采取安全防范措施的前提下开展作业活动。

137
